harness_limitations[3]: The shell fences are executed through the direct-process harness; shell tokenization itself is not under test.,"The debug output format is documented as changeable; compare_stderr is enabled to expose current jq/tq behavior, including missing tq builtins.",input_filename uses stdin for a stable <stdin> result; file-path identity is inherently temporary-process dependent.
